ADD
0x01 - add with two numbers
0x02 - add a number to a memory val
0x03 - add a memory value to a memory value

MUL
0x04 - mul with two numbers
0x05 - mul a number with a memory val
0x06 - mul two memory vals

DIV
0x07 - div with two numbers
0x08 - div a number by a mem val
0x09 - div a mem val by a mem val
0xA - div a mem val by a number

COM
0xA1 - comapre two mem vals

PTR
0xA2 - print starting from integer adress;

LOAD
0xA3 - load a number to memory

REM
0xA4 - remove a value by integer adress

GO
0xA5 - set program counter to an integer adress
